{{Under Construction}}

[[The Fractured Archive]] is ''Old School RuneScape'''s fourth raid, designed to be fought by groups of 2-8 players. 

==Requirements==
* Completion of [[While Guthix Sleeps]] for access to the Archive.

==Suggested Skills==

* {{SCP|Hitpoints|95}}+
* {{SCP|Attack|90}}+
* {{SCP|Strength|95}}+
* {{SCP|Defence|75}}+
* {{SCP|Ranged|95}}+
* {{SCP|Magic|75}}+

==Transportation==
The Fractured Archive is located in the [[Chasm of Tears]]. It can be reached by:
*[[Archivist's folio]] teleport
*[[Guthixian temple teleport]]
*[[Games necklace]] teleport to [[Tears of Guthix (minigame)|Tears of Guthix]], then enter the chasm (requires [[sapphire lantern]])
*Running from the [[Lumbridge Swamp Caves]] (requires sapphire lantern)

==Equipment==
The Fractured Archives contains many unique bosses with a plethora of defensive attributes that can make deciding which styles to bring into the raid difficult. Most encounters feature enemies extremely weak to crush, but many are also susceptible to ranged attacks and [[Combat_spells#Standard_spellbook|elemental spells]]. Depending on which rooms you take, bosses have varying levels of defence reduction, which can make certain loadouts more effective than others. 
<tabber>
Melee=
Most bosses encountered in the raid are susceptible to [[crush]] damage in varying amounts. Specifically, the final boss [[Ocellus]] is extremely weak to crush and has multiple mechanics in close quarters during his final encounter. Other bosses, the [[Archive Guardian]], [[Ezekiel]], [[Bork]], and [[Xarth]] are also particularly vulnerable to crush. 
