Offensive stat reduction is capped at 50% on [[Ocellus]], [[Xarth]] and [[Dreadnoth the Jellied|Dreadnoth]].

==Layout==
The raid consists of five bosses, of which the second, third, and fourth bosses have two choices for the player to fight. After the third boss is defeated, a [[Quartermaster (The Fractured Archive)|quartermaster ]] will arrive at the nexus area to provide supplies for the team.

The minimum scale on this raid is 2, with each additional player after the second adding +43.63% HP to the bosses.

