==Archive Guardian==
{{Main|Archive Guardian}}

The first encounter, in the Archive's central chamber, lies the Archive Guardian. It is immune to [[Ancient Magicks]], has an 80% [[elemental weakness]] to [[fire spells]], and is weakest to crush and heavy ranged attacks.

