===Phase 4===
When one quadrant remains, Ocellus will say {{Overhead|End...}}, using a different set of attacks and utilising [[Ruinous Powers|Ancient Curses]]. His stats remain the same as in the previous phase. His attacks will follow the cycle described below:
[[File:Ocellus - phase 4 ranged cycle.mp4|thumb|450px|The player demonstrates the movements required to ranged Ocellus during phase 4 of the fight.]]
[[File:Ocellus - phase 4 melee cycle.mp4|thumb|450px|The player demonstrates the movements required to melee Ocellus during phase 4 of the fight.]]
# Ocellus rises into the air and uses the [[Deflect Melee]] prayer, turning all tiles below him and one tile away from him into void. After the first cycle, Ocellus will also spawn [[Void Rift|Void Rifts]] that must be destroyed before they charge up to prevent taking damage.
# Ocellus attacks each player with a blue wind above their heads, dealing half of each player's current health as damage (rounded down). These hitpoints are transferred to a light blue orb that spawns on a safe tile and is invisible to other players. After a few seconds, the orb will animate and you can walk into it to regain the lost HP. If the orb is not collected before the attack ends, Ocellus will heal for the health stolen (this attack is a good time to use [[Vengeance]], as the initial hit will be deflected and the health can be regained). 
# Soon after the damage from step 2 is dealt, void particles will spin around every player, indicating that Ocellus will begin a void explosion attack. Every two ticks, a void explosion will begin at each player's current tile and deal damage on the next tick, requiring players to constantly move to avoid damage. While the explosions are occurring the boss takes less damage for weapons slower than 2 ticks (33% for 3t, 50% for 4t, 60% for 5t, equalizing dps to nominal attack speed). If the player dodges the void explosion tick perfectly within a 1 tile radius, their next attack will have its attack cooldown reduced by a flat 3 ticks, making 5t weapons able to attack with a 2t attack speed. This repeats six times. Explosions for any given player will not appear for or harm other players.
# Ocellus will land on the ground, removing the floor of void around him.
# Ocellus will switch to the [[Soul Split]] prayer. He will then perform a void blast that hits the entire quadrant. If the attack is not prayed against, it will deal 40+ damage; if prayed, it will deal ~6-7 damage. The attack's style is indicated by the pattern underneath the boss.
## '''{{Colour|Red|Melee}}''' (A small pulse followed by the blades forming from the outside, similar to phase 3's attack. Initially looks similar to the magic attack)
## '''{{Colour|Green|Ranged}}''' (Arrows begin pointing outwards from the boss, forming in a clockwise pattern)
## '''{{Colour|Blue|Magic}}''' (A large circle continually pulses with small rays coming out)
# Ocellus will then turn the floor of the entire quadrant into void except for the tiles directly below him and within 1 tile of him, and will begin to use the [[Deflect Range]] prayer.
# Ocellus will repeat the blue, wind-like attack and void explosion attack as described in step 2 and step 3.
# The void floor will be removed, and Ocellus will repeat the sequence described in step 5. Once the attack is complete, the entire cycle repeats. This continues until Ocellus is defeated.

